#: Map/Map_2651459344452080_events.tres, Event: EV0013 (13), Page: 0, Command 43 (Code 3 Dialog Message)
msgid "And did you know that we can use multiple dialogue scenes?"
msgstr "¿Y sabías que podemos usar múltiples escenas de diálogo?"

#: Map/Map_2651459344452080_events.tres, Event: EV0013 (13), Page: 0, Command 66 (Code 5 Choice Option)
#: Map/Map_2651459344452080_events.tres, Event: EV0013 (13), Page: 2, Command 12 (Code 5 Choice Option)
msgid "Aquatic environment"
msgstr "Medio acuático"

#: Map/Map_2651459344452080_events.tres, Event: EV0013 (13), Page: 0, Command 63 (Code 5 Choice Option)
#: Map/Map_2651459344452080_events.tres, Event: EV0013 (13), Page: 2, Command 9 (Code 5 Choice Option)
msgid "Desert Climate"
msgstr "Clima desértico"

#: Map/Map_2651459344452080_events.tres, Event: EV0013 (13), Page: 0, Command 37 (Code 3 Dialog Message)
msgid "Did you know that if you open several dialog boxes in a row,\nthe dialog box resizes dynamically to fit the new layout?"
msgstr "¿Sabías que si abres varios cuadros de diálogo seguidos,\n¿El cuadro de diálogo cambia de tamaño dinámicamente para adaptarse al nuevo diseño?"

#: Map/Map_2651459344452080_events.tres, Event: EV0013 (13), Page: 0, Command 72 (Code 5 Choice Option)
#: Map/Map_2651459344452080_events.tres, Event: EV0013 (13), Page: 2, Command 18 (Code 5 Choice Option)
msgid "Disable Follower Tracking"
msgstr "Deshabilitar el seguimiento de seguidores"

#: Map/Map_2651459344452080_events.tres, Event: EV0013 (13), Page: 0, Command 69 (Code 5 Choice Option)
#: Map/Map_2651459344452080_events.tres, Event: EV0013 (13), Page: 2, Command 15 (Code 5 Choice Option)
msgid "Enable Follower Tracking"
msgstr "Habilitar seguimiento de seguidores"

#: Map/Map_2651459344452080_events.tres, Event: EV0013 (13), Page: 0, Command 2 (Code 3 Dialog Message)
msgid "Esto es un mensaje de mierda para probar el texto de mierda"
msgstr "Esto es un mensaje de mierda para probar el texto de mierda."

#: Map/Map_2651459344452080_events.tres, Event: EV0013 (13), Page: 0, Command 85 (Code 5 Choice Option)
#: Map/Map_2651459344452080_events.tres, Event: EV0013 (13), Page: 2, Command 31 (Code 5 Choice Option)
msgid "Give me Items!"
msgstr "¡Dame artículos!"

#: Map/Map_2651459344452080_events.tres, Event: EV0003 (3), Page: 0, Command 1 (Code 3 Dialog Message)
msgid "Hey! Watch out with that! Aim at someone else!"
msgstr "¡Oye! ¡Cuidado con eso! ¡Apunta a otra persona!"

#: Map/Map_2651459344452080_events.tres, Event: EV0013 (13), Page: 0, Command 46 (Code 3 Dialog Message)
msgid "How about this one?"
msgstr "¿Qué tal este?"

#: Map/Map_2651459344452080_events.tres, Event: EV0013 (13), Page: 0, Command 52 (Code 3 Dialog Message)
msgid "How does this work for selecting text?"
msgstr "¿Cómo funciona esto para seleccionar texto?"

#: Map/Map_2651459344452080_events.tres, Event: EV0013 (13), Page: 0, Command 82 (Code 3 Dialog Message)
#: Map/Map_2651459344452080_events.tres, Event: EV0013 (13), Page: 2, Command 28 (Code 3 Dialog Message)
msgid "I've taught you your first trade! Now you can mine those mineral veins right over there!"
msgstr "¡Te enseñé tu primer oficio! ¡Ahora puedes extraer esas vetas minerales de allí!"

#: Map/Map_2651459344452080_events.tres, Event: EV0013 (13), Page: 0, Command 105 (Code 3 Dialog Message)
#: Map/Map_2651459344452080_events.tres, Event: EV0013 (13), Page: 2, Command 51 (Code 3 Dialog Message)
msgid "If you don't want anything, don't talk to me..."
msgstr "Si no quieres nada no me hables..."

#: Map/Map_2651459344452080_events.tres, Event: EV0013 (13), Page: 0, Command 109 (Code 3 Dialog Message)
msgid "In-game, you can press F9 to open the debug menu, hold down the Control\nkey to ignore obstacles while playing in the editor,\nor press Shift to run[wait type=0 seconds=0.50]\ngive it a try!"
msgstr "En el juego, puedes presionar F9 para abrir el menú de depuración, mantener presionado el botón Control\nclave para ignorar los obstáculos mientras juegas en el editor,\no presione Shift para ejecutar [tipo de espera = 0 segundos = 0,50]\n¡pruébalo!"

#: Map/Map_2651459344452080_events.tres, Event: EV0004 (4), Page: 0, Command 1 (Code 3 Dialog Message)
#: Map/Map_2651459344452080_events.tres, Event: EV0006 (6), Page: 0, Command 1 (Code 3 Dialog Message)
#: Map/Map_2651459344452080_events.tres, Event: EV0007 (7), Page: 0, Command 1 (Code 3 Dialog Message)
#: Map/Map_2651459344452080_events.tres, Event: EV0008 (8), Page: 0, Command 1 (Code 3 Dialog Message)
#: Map/Map_2651459344452080_events.tres, Event: EV0009 (9), Page: 0, Command 1 (Code 3 Dialog Message)
#: Map/Map_2651459344452080_events.tres, Event: EV0010 (10), Page: 0, Command 1 (Code 3 Dialog Message)
#: Map/Map_2651459344452080_events.tres, Event: EV0011 (11), Page: 0, Command 1 (Code 3 Dialog Message)
#: Map/Map_2651459344452080_events.tres, Event: EV0012 (12), Page: 0, Command 1 (Code 3 Dialog Message)
msgid "It seems I can't destroy this..."
msgstr "Parece que no puedo destruir esto..."

#: Map/Map_2651459344452080_events.tres, Event: EV0013 (13), Page: 0, Command 74 (Code 3 Dialog Message)
#: Map/Map_2651459344452080_events.tres, Event: EV0013 (13), Page: 2, Command 20 (Code 3 Dialog Message)
msgid "Now you can manage your followers (press L2 or R2 or key Q or Shift + Q)\n\nNote: Try stepping on the switch down there with one character to unlock\nthe chest, and use another character to reach it!"
msgstr "Ahora puedes administrar tus seguidores (presiona L2 o R2 o la tecla Q o Shift + Q)\n\nNota: intenta pisar el interruptor que está ahí abajo con un personaje para desbloquear.\n¡El cofre y usa otro personaje para alcanzarlo!"

#: Map/Map_2651459344452080_events.tres, Event: EV0013 (13), Page: 0, Command 95 (Code 3 Dialog Message)
#: Map/Map_2651459344452080_events.tres, Event: EV0013 (13), Page: 2, Command 41 (Code 3 Dialog Message)
msgid "Oops! There aren't any other maps. How about I teleport you right here on this map?"
msgstr "¡Ups! No hay otros mapas. ¿Qué tal si te teletransporto aquí mismo en este mapa?"

#: Map/Map_2651459344452080_events.tres, Event: EV0013 (13), Page: 3, Command 2 (Code 3 Dialog Message)
msgid "Profesion añadida"
msgstr "Profesión añadida"

#: Map/Map_2651459344452080_events.tres, Event: EV0013 (13), Page: 0, Command 100 (Code 5 Choice Option)
#: Map/Map_2651459344452080_events.tres, Event: EV0013 (13), Page: 2, Command 46 (Code 5 Choice Option)
msgid "Show an animation!"
msgstr "¡Muestra una animación!"

#: Map/Map_2651459344452080_events.tres, Event: EV0013 (13), Page: 0, Command 57 (Code 5 Choice Option)
#: Map/Map_2651459344452080_events.tres, Event: EV0013 (13), Page: 2, Command 3 (Code 5 Choice Option)
