msgstr "Clima de nieve"

#: Map/Map_2651459344452080_events.tres, Event: EV0013 (13), Page: 0, Command 80 (Code 5 Choice Option)
#: Map/Map_2651459344452080_events.tres, Event: EV0013 (13), Page: 2, Command 26 (Code 5 Choice Option)
msgid "Start mining minerals!"
msgstr "¡Empiece a extraer minerales!"

#: Map/Map_2651459344452080_events.tres, Event: EV0013 (13), Page: 0, Command 93 (Code 5 Choice Option)
#: Map/Map_2651459344452080_events.tres, Event: EV0013 (13), Page: 2, Command 39 (Code 5 Choice Option)
