msgstr "Teletransportarme a otro mapa"

#: Map/Map_2651459344452080_events.tres, Event: Chest (1), Page: 1, Command 1 (Code 3 Dialog Message)
msgid "The chest is already empty..."
msgstr "El cofre ya está vacío..."

#: Map/Map_2651459344452080_events.tres, Event: Chest (1), Page: 0, Command 2 (Code 3 Dialog Message)
msgid "There was nothing inside!... Wait, I think I see something shining over there..."
msgstr "¡No había nada dentro!... Espera, creo que veo algo brillando por ahí..."

#: Map/Map_2651459344452080_events.tres, Event: EV0013 (13), Page: 0, Command 114 (Code 3 Dialog Message)
msgid "Try shooting with Dadarian's bow and hit that moving NPC to see what happens!\n(Press the space bar to attack)"
msgstr "¡Intenta disparar con el arco de Dadarian y golpea a ese NPC en movimiento para ver qué pasa!\n(Presiona la barra espaciadora para atacar)"

#: Map/Map_2651459344452080_events.tres, Event: EV0013 (13), Page: 0, Command 49 (Code 3 Dialog Message)
